<title>GERMANY: German IFO business climate index down in November.</title>
<headline>German IFO business climate index down in November.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German IFO economics institute gave the following data from its November business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		     Nov 1996	  Oct 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  96.9		 97.3*</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     91.5		 91.6*</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   102.4		103.1</p>
<p>    East Germany		     Nov 1996	  Oct 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  104.8		102.5*</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     122.7		121.1</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   89.4		  86.6*</p>
<p>NOTE - * signals October figures which have been revised</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
